                "description": "Competitive real-time chess inside Telegram. Free practice vs Stockfish 17, and USDT wager matches with 95% winner payouts."
              },
              {
                "@type": "FAQPage",
                "@id": "https://web3chess.online/#faq",
                "mainEntity": [
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "Can I play chess for free on Web3Chess?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "Yes! Practising against our A.I. engine across all skill levels and solving daily puzzles is 100% free and unlimited. Matches against other human players are real-money wager games with a 1 USDT minimum stake."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How does a wager match work and who gets the pot?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "Both players deposit identical stakes from their in-app platform balance into escrow. The winner receives 95% of the total pot. 3% covers platform infrastructure and anti-cheat servers, and 2% funds affiliate referral commissions."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How do I deposit funds to play?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "Inside the Telegram Mini App, open the Wallet tab. You can deposit USDT via Telegram's native @CryptoBot invoice, or send TON directly from your personal wallet to the master deposit address with your unique reference comment."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How fast are withdrawals processed?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "You can request a withdrawal to your TON wallet at any time. Standard payouts are processed quickly after automated security verification. High-value withdrawals receive secondary review to prevent fraud. Every completed transfer is verifiable on Tonviewer."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How do you prevent opponents from using chess engines to cheat?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "All moves are executed server-side with zero client-side authority. Our backend runs real-time Stockfish 17 evaluation, centipawn loss (ACPL) heuristics, and move-timing analysis. Matches showing superhuman engine correlation are flagged and frozen for grandmaster review."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "What are the age and legal requirements to play?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                      "@type": "Answer",
                      "text": "A.I. practice and tactical puzzles are open to all ages globally. Real-money wager matches are restricted to players aged 18 and older. Players must ensure that real-money skill gaming is permissible under their local jurisdiction before wagering."
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
